# Reference of the environment variables obt reads. Set them in a .Renviron at
# the package root (R loads it at startup) or in your shell. None are required
# for normal use; the defaults assume the usual side-by-side checkout.

# Path to the outbreak-tools checkout, for developer checks that compare this
# package against the designer source. Defaults to ../outbreak-tools when unset.
OBT_SOURCE_DIR=../outbreak-tools
